Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?nebula:=20Layer=20A=20@NebulaRW=20batch=2013=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E2=80=94=2025=20entity=20tick-override=20methods=20(advances?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20DG3/B4=20coverage)?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Adds accurate @NebulaRW annotations to 25 previously-unannotated entity classes
overriding aiStep()/customServerAiStep(): Guardian, ElderGuardian,
ZombifiedPiglin, Illusioner, SpellcasterIllager, Vindicator, Creaking,
AbstractPiglin, PiglinBrute, (Zombie/Abstract/)Nautilus, GlowSquid, Camel,
SkeletonHorse, TraderLlama, AbstractHorse, Rabbit, Tadpole, HappyGhast,
CopperGolem, Pufferfish, AbstractFish, Axolotl, Armadillo. Each RWSet derived
from the actual method body (self-write fields, particle/sound events, random
call bounds). Purely additive (0 deletions). Compiles clean; mobs tick under
stress with zero errors. Entity @NebulaRW files: 64 → 89.

diff --git a/net/minecraft/world/entity/animal/armadillo/Armadillo.java b/net/minecraft/world/entity/animal/armadillo/Armadillo.java
